@Server_HostAddress = http://localhost:5290

### Health check
GET {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/scan/health
Accept: application/json

### Scan a single PE file
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/scan/file
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----ScannerBoundary

------ScannerBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.exe"
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< ./sample.exe
------ScannerBoundary--

### Scan a ZIP archive
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/scan/archive
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----ScannerBoundary

------ScannerBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.zip"
Content-Type: application/zip

< ./sample.zip
------ScannerBoundary--

### Scan a web target
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/scan/web
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetUrl": "https://example.com",
  "enableLimitedActive": false,
  "confirmedActiveTest": false
}

### Check authentication rate limiting
POST {{Server_HostAddress}}/api/scan/web/auth-rate-limit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetUrl": "https://example.com",
  "loginPath": "/login",
  "testUsername": "scanner-test-user",
  "attempts": 5,
  "confirmedControlledTestAccount": false
}
